# Recommended refactoring order

Source: DAP at e50d9eebb27f47d0f33549486751ab8bdce8de80. Read-only recommendation, 7 November 2026.

Hugh agreed with this shortlist and asked to send it and the full inventory to planner for prioritization. The ranking reflects maintenance and failure risk. The audit establishes no current defect and supplies no runtime failure evidence.

| Priority | Machine | Reason | First bounded change |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Hosted MCP transport lifetime | Opening, expiry, retirement, persistence, and stream replacement share responsibility across objects. An error could revive retired sessions or retain access beyond its deadline. | Give each transport generation one lifecycle owner. Make graceful close, detach, and abrupt discard explicit. Start in packages/mcp/src/http.ts:113, then reconcile packages/mcp/src/oauth-http.ts:6 and hosted.ts:491. |
| 2 | Shared client observation | Connection renewal, stream pumping, snapshots, cancellation, and retries interleave in one closure. Legal behavior depends on dirty/pending/refreshRunning/streamAlive/generation combinations. Many callers inherit it. | Separate connection ownership from refresh coordination. Give each connection attempt its own resources and cleanup. packages/client/src/observe.ts:63. |
| 3 | Retained editor workflow | EditTask.state does not establish required fields/verified receipts. Optional lane/proposal/version and mutable step flags require repeated rejection of invalid combinations. | Model each stage with required evidence. Centralize transitions and separate network execution. apps/room/page/src/retained-editor-data.ts:13. |
| 4 | Outside-effect driver | Dispatch, parked scanning, retained replies, retries, and publication checks share a coordinator controlling external mutations. | Extract parked scheduling and reply custody independently. Preserve durable sent mark and ledger semantics. packages/scope/src/operations.ts:228. |
| 5 | Counter voice/report controller | Audio ownership, arming, reporting, restoration, and correction interact through mutable fields. Error could replay speech or lose uncertainty. Narrower application scope lowers priority. | Separate audio execution from report settlement with explicit handoff evidence. apps/counter/browser/voice-controller.ts:132. |

Start with MCP transport retirement. Its security consequences and distributed ownership make it the strongest candidate.

Defer broad archive/fold rewrites. Existing boundaries protect subtle recovery semantics, and complexity alone does not justify replacing them.

Before each change, preserve existing witnesses for cancellation during an await, late completion after retirement, restart after a durable mark, and uncertain results. Add characterization only for an uncovered invariant. Follow docs/testing.md, run changed tests during implementation, and run npm run gate once before review. No implementation or rollout belongs to this handoff.
